            body: "Two rules make this reliable. First, the **position and size travel together** as a single `position / size` unit \u2014 the slash is mandatory when you supply a size, and it must sit directly between them. Second, anything you leave out simply is not set, so the shorthand is a *reset* for every background property it covers: a bare `background: teal` clears the image, the repeat, the position and the size as well as setting the colour."
