            body: "Web-safe fonts are free and instant, and they cap how distinctive your design can be. They also differ subtly between Windows, macOS and Linux \u2014 the font called `Georgia` is not the same file everywhere, so headings shift a little from platform to platform. That drift is the price for never waiting on a download."
