            type: "warning",
            id: "c-l64-w1",
            title: "Canvas is invisible to a screen reader",
            body: 'A screen reader sees an empty box. The content inside the tags is a fallback for browsers without canvas, not a description, and it is not read once the canvas works. Anything a canvas conveys that matters \u2014 a chart, a diagram, a drawing \u2014 needs a text alternative beside it, and the canvas itself needs `role="img"` and an `aria-label` at minimum.'
