            body: 'The name `celsius` behaves like an ordinary property from the outside \u2014 no parentheses, exactly like `profile.name`. That is the point: the call site never changes, so the guard can be added later without touching the code that reads the value. The leading underscore on `_celsius` is a convention, not a keyword; it says "this one is not for you".'
