            body: "CSS Grid is the most powerful layout system in CSS. It handles two-dimensional layouts \u2014 rows and columns at the same time \u2014 and it does so with a syntax that reads like a diagram. A card grid that used to need float hacks, inline-block whitespace fixes, or a JavaScript column counter is now three lines of CSS."
