              "**Custom viewport** \u2014 enter any width and height.",
              "**Device pixel ratio** \u2014 simulate high-density screens.",
              "**Throttling** \u2014 simulate 3G or 4G to test performance.",
              "**Screenshot** \u2014 capture the viewport at any size."
